<name>Seat Belt Warning System</name>
<para id="RM0000025J3006X" category="J" type-id="301CF" name-id="560ZP-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Front Passenger Side Seat Belt Warning Light Does Not Operate</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000025J3006X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AFC00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The combination meter assembly (meter ECU) detects the condition of the front seat inner belt assembly LH when the front passenger seat is occupied with the IG ON. The combination meter assembly (meter ECU) blinks the front passenger seat belt warning light on the air conditioner control assembly when the tongue plate is not inserted into the buckle, and turns it off when the tongue plate is inserted.</ptxt>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000025J3006X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AFD00000">
